Budget Alert — <%= @category_name %>
=====================================

Hi <%= @user.name.present? ? @user.name.split(' ').first : 'there' %>,

Your spending in <%= @category_name %> has reached <%= @pct_used %>% of your budget.

  Budgeted:  <%= number_to_currency(@budgeted) %>
